    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Holy Carrot Simulator</i> is a chill first-person farming game where the Holy Carrot\u00a0asks for your help to plant vegetables, earn money, and to summon his friends, the three Holy Veggies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your garden with simple mechanics like buying seeds, dealing with moles, tossing leaves out of the garden, and mowing the lawn regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring colorful, cartoon-style graphics, this short and relaxing game (1\u20132 hours) offers a unique twist !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and relaxing first-person planting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage garden tasks: seed buying, mole-whacking, leaf disposal, and lawn mowing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, cartoon-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, engaging playtime (1 to 2 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous and chill tone with a twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f A controller is required for local multiplayer.</p>",
